build C$:\Users\NeoProg\Desktop\balancer\WheelBalancer\Debug\BrowseInfo\main.pbi : INDEXER C$:\Users\NeoProg\Desktop\balancer\WheelBalancer\Debug\BrowseInfo\main.xcl |  $
C$:\Users\NeoProg\Desktop\balancer\WheelBalancer\main.cpp
  flags = -out=C$:\Users\NeoProg\Desktop\balancer\WheelBalancer\Debug\BrowseInfo\main.pbi -f C$:\Users\NeoProg\Desktop\balancer\WheelBalancer\Debug\BrowseInfo\main.xcl

